@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:recovery] installation-only-storage
Profiles MUST NOT format storage on boot or activation. EC2 data loss MUST leave
system storage and SSH available, with readiness withheld until reconciliation.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:capacity] explicit-host-budgets
Host profiles MUST require exactly explicit guest CPU, memory and ARC budgets, or
exactly the ARC budget on Lilly-free hcloud hosts, and refuse the retired logical
budget. Lilly binding pools MUST carry exactly id,
name, filesystem_id and storage. Hetzner guests MUST have a reviewed physical
quota; EC2 local storage MUST exclude every EBS disk.
